  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>Discord<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8nahPuvkqx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/8nahPuvkqx</a><br><span style=\"color:#169179\">Twitter(X)<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fTehen4649\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Tehen4649</a><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube<br><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TEHEN_4649/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@TEHEN_4649/videos</a></span></span><br><br>英语</strong></span></h1>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>禁止未经授权访问或提取内部数据<br><br></strong></span></h1>\n<h3><br><strong>音效提供：<br>・<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundeffect-lab.info%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundeffect-lab.info/</a><br>・</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fotologic.jp%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://otologic.jp/</a></strong></h3>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h2><strong>{前置模组}</strong></h2>\n<p>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files/4587214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Player Animator</strong></a></p>\n<p>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>{概述}</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>[默认按键绑定]</strong></p>\n<p><strong>N</strong>: 发动技能</p>\n<p><strong>R</strong>: 切换技能</p>\n<p><strong>H</strong>: 使用反转术式（需满足条件）<br><br><strong>J</strong>: 使用简易领域（需满足条件）</p>\n<p><strong>V + (A或D)</strong>: 闪避</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【指令与游戏规则】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>/setplayerlevel [玩家名称] [0~100]</strong></p>\n<p>修改指定玩家的等级。</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule onlymodentityspawn&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>: 仅生成模组角色</p>\n<p><strong>false</strong>: 也会生成原版生物</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule lockplayerlevel</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>: 玩家等级将不再变化</p>\n<p><strong>false</strong>: 玩家等级将正常变化</p>\n<p>【玩家等级】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_4e9a0b66-d5b2-4101-8de3-a04c92056932.png\" width=\"342\" height=\"229\"><br><br></p>\n<p>物品栏界面会显示玩家等级以及升级所需经验值。<br>随着玩家等级提升，各项属性也会随之增加。</p>\n<p>击败敌人、发动黑闪以及完成任务可获得经验值。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_b04236c0-2ced-44d0-88cc-8c9379bf5aec.png\"><br><em>此经验值与原版经验值独立计算。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br>【特殊技能】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_65bb767e-a723-4545-9e6c-67abed1826cc.png\" width=\"298\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p>消耗屏幕左上角显示的计量条可发动特殊技能。<br>消耗特殊计量条的技能名称将以紫色发光显示。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_ce9472b7-04ab-4753-817c-7d06bfcb63e8.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>【任务】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_2d0c82b0-d6f2-4e77-89f7-9059dc649356.png\" width=\"111\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>使用物品<strong>“任务书”</strong>即可开始任务。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_bc2987c0-b7c8-49ab-986c-b961efc4c52f.png\"></p>\n<div>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><em>任务需达到10级方可挑战。</em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p>【建筑】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_62aa1bbc-5e8a-458c-bf9f-610391b06c18.png\"></p>\n<p>现已新增可生成的建筑。<br>这些建筑中偶尔会藏有稀有宝箱。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_661ee932-89f3-414a-a6dd-5784f6e73f7b.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>*若技能名称未显示，请尝试降低Forge版本，并避免游玩带有地图显示或添加覆盖层（UI叠加）的模组。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">日本語<br><br></span></strong></h1>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">禁止未经授权访问或提取内部数据</span></strong></h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n</article>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>{前置模组}</strong></h2>\n<h3>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files/4587214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Player Animator</strong></span></a></h3>\n<h3>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></span></a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;{概述}</strong></h2>\n<h4>【按键设置】※默认</h4>\n<p><strong>N 发动技能</strong></p>\n<p><strong>R 切换技能</strong></p>\n<p><strong>H 使用反转术式（需满足条件）<br><br>J 使用简易领域（需满足条件）<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>V+(A或D) 闪避</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>【指令与游戏规则】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>/setplayerlevel [玩家名称] [0~100]</strong></p>\n<p>修改指定玩家的等级。</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule onlymodentityspawn&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>: 仅生成模组角色</p>\n<p><strong>false</strong>: 也会生成原版生物</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule lockplayerlevel</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>: 玩家等级将不再变化</p>\n<p><strong>false:</strong> 玩家等级将正常变化</p>\n<p>【玩家等级】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_4e9a0b66-d5b2-4101-8de3-a04c92056932.png\" width=\"342\" height=\"229\"><br><br></p>\n<p>物品栏界面会显示<strong>玩家等级</strong>以及<strong>升级所需经验值</strong>。<br>随着等级提升，玩家的各项属性也会随之增加。</p>\n<p>可通过<strong>击败敌人</strong>、<strong>发动黑闪</strong>、<strong>完成任务</strong>获得经验值。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_b04236c0-2ced-44d0-88cc-8c9379bf5aec.png\"><br>※此经验值与原版经验值独立</p>\n<hr>\n<p><br>【特殊技能】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_65bb767e-a723-4545-9e6c-67abed1826cc.png\" width=\"298\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p>消耗屏幕左上角显示的计量条可发动特殊技能。<br>消耗特殊计量条的技能名称将以紫色发光显示。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_ce9472b7-04ab-4753-817c-7d06bfcb63e8.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>【任务】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_2d0c82b0-d6f2-4e77-89f7-9059dc649356.png\" width=\"111\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>使用物品<strong>“任务书”</strong>即可开始任务。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_bc2987c0-b7c8-49ab-986c-b961efc4c52f.png\"></p>\n<p>※任务需达到10级方可挑战。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>【建筑】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_62aa1bbc-5e8a-458c-bf9f-610391b06c18.png\"></p>\n<p>现已新增可生成的建筑。<br>这些建筑中偶尔会藏有稀有宝箱。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_661ee932-89f3-414a-a6dd-5784f6e73f7b.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><strong>※若技能名称未显示，请尝试降低Forge版本，并避免游玩带有地图显示或添加覆盖层（UI叠加）的模组。</strong></p>",
